| Secondary text | `color.text.muted` | `#475569` | `#94a3b8` |

Use a semantic role such as “text on primary,” not the action color itself, for a button label. Validate the actual pairing, component size, disabled state, focus state, and selected brand. Color must not be the only signal of status.

